OL,3,GNEWSAWWII veteran celebrates 101st
OL,4,Abirthday in Looe
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorld War Two veteran David Lightfoot
OL,7,Fcelebrated his 101 birthday on 6
OL,8,FNovember, and has been reflecting on
OL,9,Fhis time in the armed forces, when aged
OL,10,F19 he joined thousands of troops in
OL,11,FIndia, then still part of the British
OL,12,FEmpire.
OL,14,FHe tells the remarkable story of when
OL,15,Fhe went to the cinema in India and a
OL,16,Fholiday advert appeared of Polperro,
OL,17,FCornwall, his home town.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
