OL,3,GNEWSAWWII veteran celebrates 101st
OL,4,Abirthday in Looe
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid said: "They (the film maker)
OL,7,Fshowed the oldest house in Polperro
OL,8,Fthere and this Pamela Gardener was
OL,9,Fwalking along to what was the Post
OL,10,FOffice, and I said 'Oh that's where I
OL,11,Flive'.
OL,13,F"Then (the film maker) went further
OL,14,Falong by the harbour and I could see
OL,15,Fthe field that I'd ploughed before I
OL,16,Fleft home (to join up)," he said.
